# Duration Slider — a Skia circular slider (1..12): dragging the picker knob
# (react-native-skia-gesture Touchable.Path) around the ring sweeps the red
# arc, updates the big Skia number and fires a selection haptic per value.
# What this test covers: dragging the knob clockwise a full lap in quarter steps
# (top -> right -> bottom -> left -> top, crossing the 12 -> 1 seam), the reverse
# lap counter-clockwise, a drag straight through the centre (atan2 near 0,0),
# a drag that leaves the ring far outside, taps on the ring away from the knob
# (must not move it), and a fast zig-zag across the seam.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/duration-slider"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait 2000
# Ring centre (201,437), knob radius ~116; knob starts at the top (201,321).
gesture pan 201 321 116 116 700
wait 600
gesture pan 317 437 -116 116 700
wait 600
gesture pan 201 553 -116 -116 700
wait 600
gesture pan 85 437 116 -116 700
wait 800
# Past the top seam to the right (12 -> 1), then back counter-clockwise.
gesture pan 201 321 40 4 400
wait 600
gesture pan 241 325 -156 112 900
wait 600
gesture pan 85 437 116 116 700
wait 600
gesture pan 201 553 116 -116 700
wait 600
# Through the centre to the opposite side.
gesture pan 317 437 -232 0 1200
wait 800
# Out of the ring and far away (finger leaves the canvas).
gesture pan 85 437 -60 250 800
wait 800
# Taps on the ring away from the knob.
press 317 437
wait 400
press 201 321
wait 800
# Fast zig-zag over the seam from wherever the knob is: grab at bottom-left.
gesture pan 120 520 80 -199 250
gesture pan 201 321 60 10 150
gesture pan 261 331 -110 -5 150
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
